cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this template in research, blog posts, or case studies,
  please cite it as below. The DOI is optional — GitHub will mint one
  automatically once you publish a release.
type: software
title: "Media Fabrique Template"
abstract: >-
  Self-hosted RSS → LLM-rewriter → WordPress / Telegram pipeline. A
  template for building topic-specific news automation on a single VPS.
  SQLite for state, system cron for orchestration, OpenAI-compatible
  LLM, Telegraph mirror for Instant View without Premium.
authors:
  - name: "Media Fabrique Authors"
    alias: "media-fabrique"
date-released: 2026-07-26
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/DimbikeY/media-fabrique-template"
repository-code: "https://github.com/DimbikeY/media-fabrique-template"
keywords:
  - rss
  - telegram
  - wordpress
  - llm
  - openai
  - sqlite
  - pipeline
  - news-automation
  - template
  - starter
  - self-hosted
references:
